          "content": "Write down the starting chemical composition and product form; define whether reported fractions are by area, mass, atoms or volume; and record the process history that could alter **orientation and test temperature**. For any local observation, describe why its sampling plan represents the part. Treat **microstructural sampling** as an explicit rival explanation and plan **orientation-independent diffraction** as an independent check.",
